<p> A Heroic Choice & Tragedy <br>
<b>The Ultimate Sacrifice </b> is <i> Peter Parker’s life is upended after his secret identity is exposed to the world. Seeking a way to reclaim his anonymity, he asks Doctor Strange to cast a spell making everyone forget he is Spider-Man. However, Peter’s constant interruptions cause the spell to malfunction, accidentally pulling in legendary villains from other universes—including Green Goblin and Doc Ock—who already know his secret. Refusing to send them back to their deaths, Peter attempts to "cure" them of their powers, a decision that leads to the tragic death of Aunt May. In his darkest hour, he is joined by two alternate versions of himself (Tobey Maguire and Andrew Garfield), who help him defeat and heal the villains. To save the multiverse from collapsing entirely, Peter makes the ultimate sacrifice: he has Strange cast a final spell that wipes the memory of Peter Parker from everyone's minds, leaving him completely alone and forgotten, but free to continue his heroics as a truly anonymous Spider-Man. </i> easy <br>
